.TH tumindmap n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tumindmap
.PP
Parses a Mermaid \fBmindmap\fR block into a \fBtclutils::tudiagram\fR model, so a mindmap can render natively (SVG or PNG) through the pure\-Tcl engine — no browser. It is one of the graph\-type parsers the \fBtclutils::tuflow\fR facade dispatches to; you normally call \fBtuflow::toPng\fR / \fBtuflow::toSvg\fR rather than this module directly.
.SS Package
.CS
package require tclutils::tumindmap 0.1
.CE
.SS Commands
.CS
::tclutils::tumindmap::parse text      ;# -> tudiagram model dict
.CE
.PP
The result is a \fBtudiagram\fR model and is rendered with \fBtclutils::tudiagram::toSvg\fR / \fBtoPng\fR (or via the \fBtuflow\fR facade).
.SS "Supported syntax (Mermaid subset)"
.CS
indentation      -> hierarchy (relative: a deeper line is a child of the
                    nearest line with smaller indent; tabs count as 4 spaces)
parent -> child  -> edges, drawn without an arrowhead (mindmap connectors)
node shapes:
    ((text))                      -> circle
    {{text}}                      -> hexagon
    [text] (square)               -> box
    (text) / plain text           -> rounded
    )text(    ))text((            -> rounded (cloud/bang, no native shape)
id[text] etc.    -> a leading id token is dropped; the bracket text is the label
.CE
.SS Usage
.CS
package require tclutils::tumindmap
package require tclutils::tudiagram

set src {mindmap
  root((Project))
    Planning
      Scope
      Budget
    Build
      Backend
      Frontend
}
set m [::tclutils::tumindmap::parse $src]
::tclutils::tudiagram::writePng $m mindmap.png -scale 3
.CE
.SS Notes
.IP \(bu
v1 limitations (honest): the result is laid out as a top\-down layered tree (\fBtudiagram\fR), not the radial Mermaid layout; node ids are generated, so an explicit mindmap id is used only as a label source and never as the id; \fB::icon(...)\fR and \fBclass\fR decorator lines are ignored; markdown inside a label is kept verbatim.
.IP \(bu
Companion: \fBtclutils::tudiagram\fR (renderer), \fBtclutils::tuflow\fR (dispatch).
.SS "Error codes"
.PP
\fB\-errorcode {TCLUTILS TUMINDMAP <REASON>}\fR — \fBEMPTY\fR (no nodes found).
